{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_9001_p", "source_sha256": "f3154626014fed630c2e67ce39e965b68eeef150222c491c733dd3c8cfd4a5d1", "ja": "（今日はアイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア\n撮影。亜利沙のテーマは『反抗期メイド』だ）", "zh": "（今天要为偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》拍摄写真。\n亚利沙的主题是“叛逆期女仆”）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_9002_028ari", "source_sha256": "8e58eb78d0e5e9df41073b43cb575bebd0d6b4f956367fd782714e4dd79d613d", "ja": "メイドなのに反抗期！？　と最初は驚きましたケド、\n今ならわかります。このテーマの良さが……！", "zh": "明明是女仆，却是叛逆期！？一开始我还吓了一跳，不过现在我明白了。这个主题的妙处……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_9003_p", "source_sha256": "a4a6abb68e9afe87dad61ed96f35462d50dafdaaef316f5978abad2222c2b41d", "ja": "確かに。撮影中もすごくよかったって\n褒めてもらってたしな。この調子で残りも頑張ろう！", "zh": "确实。拍摄过程中也得到了很多夸奖。照这个势头，剩下的部分也继续加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_9004_028ari", "source_sha256": "6bdc1c1f3245f276d6023bc4999ba7d6961eb984ac25d0f153cb0e5b5cabbe82", "ja": "はい！　もちろんです！　ですが、気づいてしまった\nからには、逃れられない宿命というものもありまして。", "zh": "是！当然了！可是，既然已经察觉到了，就有一种无法逃避的宿命。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_9005_p", "source_sha256": "d2647cfa98cd6b49dee4223505264b4dc7c23f3293251bf926b368e7333bc9b4", "ja": "逃れられない宿命……？ってなんだ？", "zh": "无法逃脱的宿命……？那是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_9006_028ari", "source_sha256": "406ad723d1a0c4988f1c9b850ba1075019e53f1278fba0889b27e42d6d0b3a1b", "ja": "気になりますか？　気になりますよね！？\nでも今のありさは『反抗期メイド』なので教えません！", "zh": "您很在意吗？您很在意吧！？\n不过现在的亚利纱可是“叛逆期女仆”，所以不告诉您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_9007", "source_sha256": "609ba2d2b6d527da0b9ad3ce59780a32204b0406970d0c843ac19bd6182b4951", "ja": "その調子だ！", "zh": "就是这个劲头！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_9008", "source_sha256": "7e51444e425fc0d85d31ec9a065a1441085604fd5be77303847c13f813a6bc31", "ja": "そこをなんとか！", "zh": "请想想办法！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_9200_p", "source_sha256": "7add65b13ad93cd805337f10b78f9c6775843100d8e10ae02a9d0c9ad6039824", "ja": "くっ。すごく気になるけど、亜利沙の言うとおりだ。\n撮影が終わった後に、教えてほしい。", "zh": "唔。虽然非常在意，但确实正如亚利沙所说。\n等拍摄结束之后，希望能告诉我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_9201_028ari", "source_sha256": "3145f8c2c63d5ff7ae900bb005fe75a8a8a692f8a1a599a616c07efcdde80e7c", "ja": "いいんですか、{$P$}さん。ありさの\n反抗期が撮影後に終わるとも限りませんよ……？", "zh": "这样真的好吗，{$P$}先生？亚利沙的叛逆期也不一定会在拍摄结束后结束哦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_9202_028ari", "source_sha256": "49f2e3014be122fa8c89b46ab2d02bd7515e57b7b2e372f3d4874d225aed83ac", "ja": "モヤモヤした気持ちのまま、夜も眠れなくなって……。\nふっふっふっ……これがありさの反抗期です！", "zh": "带着这种郁闷的心情，连晚上都睡不着了……。\n哼哼哼……这就是亚利沙的叛逆期！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_9300_p", "source_sha256": "7add65b13ad93cd805337f10b78f9c6775843100d8e10ae02a9d0c9ad6039824", "ja": "くっ。すごく気になるけど、亜利沙の言うとおりだ。\n撮影が終わった後に、教えてほしい。", "zh": "唔。虽然非常在意，但确实正如亚利沙所说。\n等拍摄结束之后，希望能告诉我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_9301_028ari", "source_sha256": "af53ef83105e3568f753069a1c5b20456e16d09faa2762b89d55aab854ad5b59", "ja": "甘いですよ、{$P$}さん。反抗期は\nすぐに終わらな……えっ？　この前のライブの映像を？", "zh": "您太天真了，{$P$}先生。叛逆期很快就会结束……诶？要看前阵子演唱会的录像？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_9302_028ari", "source_sha256": "05c2ea6fbfed63ac05e08a188ba08379d0e5cfa36ed47134c09aa352816fa04c", "ja": "そんな！　ありさの計画が！？　ううっ、翻弄する\nつもりが、逆にありさが翻弄されてしまいました……。", "zh": "怎么会这样！亚利沙的计划！？呜呜，本来是想捉弄你的，结果反而被你捉弄了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_9500_p", "source_sha256": "5618a3b6a3d53d8f72a0f81b860ce7c113720b5074d72724253dca291a0a2386", "ja": "亜利沙の言うとおり気になって落ち着かないんだ。\n……だから教えてくれないかな？　このとおりだ！", "zh": "就像亚利沙说的那样，我好奇得坐立不安。\n……所以能告诉我吗？拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_9501_028ari", "source_sha256": "5fde50dbdf0e849756359c52f03a426ef7fe67c1570c5e856417a1a7c3f5ec7e", "ja": "ふおおぉっ、さすが{$P$}さんっ！\nありさの欲しかった反応を完璧にしてくれるっ……！", "zh": "呜哦哦哦，真不愧是{$P$}先生！\n完美地给出了小有想要的反应……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_9502_028ari", "source_sha256": "ab875768034acd2505d8b4241b343671491333836899173c43e5e559609956e9", "ja": "そうです！　逃れられない宿命とはつまり！\n今この瞬間のこと……！　ありがとうございます！！", "zh": "没错！所谓无法逃避的宿命，就是指此时此刻……！谢谢您！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_9600_p", "source_sha256": "5618a3b6a3d53d8f72a0f81b860ce7c113720b5074d72724253dca291a0a2386", "ja": "亜利沙の言うとおり気になって落ち着かないんだ。\n……だから教えてくれないかな？　このとおりだ！", "zh": "就像亚利沙说的那样，我好奇得坐立不安。\n……所以能告诉我吗？拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_9601_028ari", "source_sha256": "27edcbc4eef164acffda45e0f9f48aee023a95b76212c318cdf2cbb247fea509", "ja": "よくわかります、その気持ち。でもこれは反抗期だから\nこその行動なのです。……わかってくれますよね？", "zh": "我很明白您的心情。不过，这正是因为处于叛逆期才会有的行为。……您能理解吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_028ari_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_028ari_9602_028ari", "source_sha256": "435133ddfd5766af2c1351d2737ece21b380e35f75e265cbb69f0052877229a4", "ja": "お願いされたからといって教えるわけにはいきません。\nふふふ……それじゃ、撮影に行ってきますね。ふふふ。", "zh": "不能因为有人拜托，就把这个告诉你。\n呵呵呵……那么，我去拍摄了。呵呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
